# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Jon Beton (00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001)
POST {{baseUrl}}/gotcha/opt-in
Authorization: Bearer dev-jon
Content-Type: application/json
X-Profile-ID: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
X-Campus: Campus Stad

{}

